  "scope": "Bounded native registration in an existing actual regular Space. Current original native app admission, missing fixed-root creation and missing hidden attachment repair. No historical-observation input, root-only repair, create retry, cross-client uniqueness, ordinary annotation create, Swift/RPC exposure, identity/body authority or ACK.",
  "mutation_semantics": "Each actual original create and normal type Apply has its own native boundary; phases survive error/cancellation and no batch rollback is claimed. The original native insert owns fixed-root collision admission.",
  "lifecycle_semantics": "WithActiveApp retains a synchronous application read-lock; no nested GetApp/lifecycle call. Account close/replacement requiring the writer lock waits. Stop may acknowledge queued-Select cancellation before drain; original Select end() can close only after that writer lock is acquired.",
  "format_semantics": "Actual Windows Go1.25.6 formatter; pinned macOS Go1.26.5 must report source equality without rewriting frozen bytes."
